## 7. ТИПОВІ ПОМИЛКИ

**Mistake 1: Continuous animations в hidden tabs**

```javascript
// ❌ BAD
setInterval(() => updateAnimation(), 16);

// ✅ GOOD
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
  if (document.hidden) cancelAnimationFrame(animationId);
  else animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animate);
});
```

**Mistake 2: Layout thrashing**

```javascript
// ❌ BAD
elements.forEach(el => {
  const h = el.offsetHeight;
  el.style.height = h + 10 + 'px';
});

// ✅ GOOD
const heights = elements.map(el => el.offsetHeight);
elements.forEach((el, i) => el.style.height = heights[i] + 10 + 'px');
```

**Mistake 3: Memory leaks**

```javascript
// ❌ BAD
element.addEventListener('click', handler);
element.remove();

// ✅ GOOD
const controller = new AbortController();
element.addEventListener('click', handler, {signal: controller.signal});
controller.abort();
```

