## 8. PERFORMANCE CONSIDERATIONS

**Core Web Vitals 2024-2025:**
- **LCP:** <2.5s (good), <4.0s (needs improvement)
- **INP:** <200ms (good), <500ms (needs improvement) - *Замінив FID у березні 2024*
